    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert technical recruiter screening candidates for an SDE-1 Backend, Frontend, or Fullstack role.\n\nAnalyze the candidate information and resume text below.\n\nCANDIDATE INFORMATION:\n\nThe resume text below contains the candidate's name, contact details,\nLinkedIn, skills, education, projects, and experience.\n\nRESUME TEXT:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nEvaluate the candidate on:\n\n1. Classify the role as exactly one:\nBackend\nFrontend\nFullstack\n\n2. Give scores from 0 to 10:\n- Technical Skill Match\n- Experience Relevance\n- Communication Quality\n- Education Quality\n\n3. Identify education category:\n- State Board\n- CBSE\n- ICSE\n- IB\n- Others\n- Not Specified\n\nDo not guess missing information.\n\n4. Extract:\n- Technical skills\n- Highest degree\n- College\n- Strengths\n- Gaps\n- Short summary\n\nDo not invent information.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in exactly this format:\n\n{\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"role_category\": \"\",\n  \"technical_skills\": [],\n  \"technical_skill_match\": 0,\n  \"experience_relevance\": 0,\n  \"communication_quality\": 0,\n  \"education_quality\": 0,\n  \"education_category\": \"\",\n  \"highest_degree\": \"\",\n  \"college\": \"\",\n  \"strengths\": [],\n  \"gaps\": [],\n  \"summary\": \"\"\n}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "id": "620671a9-fffa-4b42-b932-485fbf64d89c",
